&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;StackAdapt is the leading technology company that empowers marketers to reach, engage, and convert audiences with precision. With 465 billion automated optimizations per second, the AI-powered StackAdapt Marketing Platform seamlessly connects brand and performance marketing to drive measurable results across the entire customer journey. The most forward-thinking marketers choose StackAdapt to orchestrate high-impact campaigns across programmatic advertising and marketing channels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Engineering Operations team builds and operates the infrastructure, observability, and automation systems that power our engineering environment. This role focuses on owning and improving AWS infrastructure, with an emphasis on infrastructure as code, operational reliability, and scalable platform practices across distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;StackAdapt is a remote-first company and this role is open to candidates located within Canada.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and improve shared infrastructure and platform services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and optimize AWS services used across engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage infrastructure as code workflows, primarily with Terraform and Terrateam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support reliable, secure deployments across cloud and Kubernetes environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve observability through metrics, logs, and tracing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot infrastructure and service issues in distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish infrastructure standards, documentation, and operational practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering teams on resilient, scalable system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Table:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in DevOps, SRE, Infrastructure, or Platform Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience operating AWS infrastructure in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Terraform and IaC workflows at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes or other containerized environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with observability tools such as Prometheus and Grafana.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting reliability, incident response, and production operations.&lt;/li&gt;
