&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;CLEAR is building THE secure identity company of the future. Our mission is to make experiences safer and easier—physically and digitally. With more than 43 million Members and a growing network of partners across the world, CLEAR&#39;s secure identity platform is transforming the way people live, work, and travel. Whether it’s at the airport, stadium, or throughout your everyday life, CLEAR unlocks the magic of frictionless experiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an iOS Engineer to help us build the next generation of products that go beyond just ID, enabling our members to seamlessly navigate an increasingly connected world with digital identity at the core.&amp;nbsp; As a Software Engineer at CLEAR, you will contribute to the design, implementation, testing, and deployment of applications that enhance our platform—one that interconnects dozens of attributes and qualifications while keeping member privacy and security at the forefront.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This role is in the Members org at CLEAR, which focuses on building amazing consumer experiences in the CLEAR Mobile iOS app in close collaboration with various engineering and product teams across the company. Mobile is becoming an increasingly central part of our user experience, and this role provides an opportunity to have a significant impact on how members interact with CLEAR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
