&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and deliver code across the mobile stack, building delightful user experiences and championing engineering excellence through best practices in app architecture, testing, observability and documentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
