&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to advancing our capabilities across a wide array of industries and domains while gaining hands-on experience with privacy, security, data modeling, and architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Take ownership of your work, contribute to architectural decisions, and continuously seek ways to improve technology and processes at CLEAR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
