&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We keep a swift process with shorter timelines that make the best use of everyone’s time.&amp;nbsp; Our process is usually completed in about 3 weeks.&amp;nbsp; Here’s what you can expect:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
