&lt;li&gt;Adopt a security-centric approach to both architecture and coding to guarantee the resilience and safety of networking modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and optimize the performance, reliability, and scale of our software across a wide array of technical platforms and hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
